# Qt 6.4.2 software-rendered fallback dialogs retain icon images/textures on exit.
# Reproduced with a standalone Qt-only FileDialog app (no bridge libraries).
# Apply only to gui_smoke on Linux Qt 6.4.2 ASan builds; headless tests have no
# suppression. Remove/recheck when the Ubuntu runtime SDK changes.
leak:QQuickPixmap::setImage
leak:QSGRenderContext::textureForFactory
